<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Order Placed - {{orderId}}</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&display=swap');
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#050608;font-family:'Inter', 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, sans-serif;color:#f5f5f5;">
  <div style="padding:20px 8px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;">
    <table role="presentation" align="center" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#131416;border:1px solid #23262b;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;">
            <div style="margin-bottom:14px;text-align:center;">
              <table align="center" role="presentation" style="margin:0 auto;border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
                <td style="padding:0 8px;"><span style="font-size:32px;vertical-align:middle;">🛒</span></td>
                <td style="padding:0 8px;"><span style="font-size:32px;vertical-align:middle;">⭐</span></td>
                <td style="padding:0 8px;"><span style="font-size:32px;vertical-align:middle;">✅</span></td>
              </tr></table>
            </div>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding-right:8px;vertical-align:top;"><span style="background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0f172a 0%,#1e293b 55%,#0f172a 100%);color:#fff;width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:800;border-radius:4px;border-right:3px solid #d4af37;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(15,23,42,0.22);line-height:34px;">E</span></td>
              <td style="display:table-cell;line-height:1;padding:0;vertical-align:top;"><span style="display:block;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2.4px;font-size:18px;color:#f5f7fb;line-height:1;">SHOPPER</span><span style="display:block;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#d4af37;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;line-height:1.1;">BOUTIQUE LUXE</span></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <span style="float:right;display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#000000;border:1px solid #d4af37;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #d4af37 0%, #aa8222 100%);padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;">RECEIVED</span>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#111111,#1a1813);border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;text-align:center;padding:35px 15px;">
          <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px;color:#d4af37;margin-bottom:12px;">Thank you, {{userName}}</div>
          <h1 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;margin:0;">ORDER PLACED</h1>
          <div style="color:#c5a059;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:14px;">Order #{{orderId}}</div>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:30px 20px;border-top:1px solid #272a30;">
          <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;font-size:22px;color:#d4af37;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 14px;">Hi {{userName}},</h2>
          <p style="color:#d6dae2;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px;">We've successfully received your order. Our luxury processing desk is currently reviewing your selection.</p>
          <p style="color:#d6dae2;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px;">We will notify you via email and SMS the moment your order is confirmed and moves to our premium packaging phase.</p>
          
          <div style="margin-top:24px;background:#0a0a0c;border:1px solid #2a2a2a;border-radius:8px;padding:20px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;color:#d4af37;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;">The Luxe Journey</h3>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;">
              <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1813;border:1px solid #d4af37;color:#d4af37;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-right:12px;flex-shrink:0;">1</div>
              <div style="font-size:14px;color:#c8cdd7;line-height:1.5;padding-top:4px;"><strong style="color:#ffffff;">Order Placement:</strong> We received your request. (Current)</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:16px;">
              <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1813;border:1px solid #d4af37;color:#d4af37;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-right:12px;flex-shrink:0;">2</div>
              <div style="font-size:14px;color:#c8cdd7;line-height:1.5;padding-top:4px;"><strong style="color:#ffffff;">Confirmation:</strong> Our team verifies your items.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:0;">
              <div style="width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#1a1813;border:1px solid #d4af37;color:#d4af37;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-right:12px;flex-shrink:0;">3</div>
              <div style="font-size:14px;color:#c8cdd7;line-height:1.5;padding-top:4px;"><strong style="color:#ffffff;">Preparation:</strong> 10-point quality check &amp; eco-luxe packing.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <a href="https://eshopperr.me" target="_blank" style="display:block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;border-radius:4px;padding:16px 12px;font-size:16px;margin-top:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #d4af37 0%, #aa8222 100%);color:#000000;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;">CONTINUE SHOPPING</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:24px 14px;border-top:1px solid #1a1a1a;text-align:center;color:#9ea4b2;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;background:#0b0c0e;">
          <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;color:#d4af37;font-size:20px;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:12px;">Join our Luxe community</div>
          <div>&copy; 2024 E-Shopper Boutique Luxe. All rights reserved.</div>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px;">
            <a href="https://eshopperr.me/privacy" target="_blank" style="color:#d4af37;text-decoration:none;margin:0 6px;">Privacy</a> | 
            <a href="https://eshopperr.me/terms" target="_blank" style="color:#d4af37;text-decoration:none;margin:0 6px;">Terms</a>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
